ontserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#07263f;margin:8px 0 8px 0;">IFMG: 49 vagas em 15 campi</h3><p style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.62;color:#1d2b36;margin:0 0 10px 0;">O Edital 1.077/2026 foi publicado em 07/10 com 33 vagas, e a Retificação 01, de 09/10, levou o quadro para 49 vagas em 15 campi. Muitos sites ainda mostram 33. A prova é objetiva e dissertativa.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f1f3e6;border-radius:8px;margin:0 0 14px 0;"><tr><td align="center" valign="top" class="stat" style="padding:10px 4px;"><div style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#0c3d64;line-height:1.1;">49</div><div style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#5a6772;margin-top:4px;">vagas de professor</div></td><td align="center" valign="top" class="stat" style="padding:10px 4px;"><div style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#0c3d64;line-height:1.1;">15</div><div style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#5a6772;margin-top:4px;">campi</div></td><td align="center" valign="top" class="stat" style="padding:10px 4px;"><div style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#0c3d64;line-height:1.1;">13/11</div><div style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#5a6772;margin-top:4px;">fim das inscrições, até 18h</div></td><td align="center" valign="top" class="stat" style="padding:10px 4px;"><div style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px;f