p:1px solid #d9dfd0;background:#f8f9f2;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;color:#07263f;">IFF<div style="font-weight:600;font-size:11px;color:#5a6772;">RJ</div></td><td align="right" style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#1d2b36;padding:10px 10px;border-top:1px solid #d9dfd0;background:#f8f9f2;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;">47</td><td style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#1d2b36;padding:10px 10px;border-top:1px solid #d9dfd0;background:#f8f9f2;vertical-align:top;">Banca definida: Instituto AOCP (extrato no DOU em 21/10). Previsão de cerca de 67 vagas, 42 de professor EBTT e 25 de TAE, em dois editais.</td></tr><tr><td style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#1d2b36;padding:10px 10px;border-top:1px solid #d9dfd0;background:#ffffff;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;color:#07263f;">IF Goiano<div style="font-weight:600;font-size:11px;color:#5a6772;">GO</div></td><td align="right" style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#1d2b36;padding:10px 10px;border-top:1px solid #d9dfd0;background:#ffffff;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;">47</td><td style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#1d2b36;padding:10px 10px;border-top:1px solid #d9dfd0;background:#ffffff;vertical-align:top;">Banca definida: UFG, por meio da fundação de apoio, para Professor EBTT. Vagas a definir.</td></tr><tr><td style="font-family:'Montserrat', 'Segoe UI', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#1d2b36;padding:10px 10px;border-top:1px solid #d9dfd0;background:#f8f9f2;vertical-align:top;font-weight:800;color:#07263f;">IFFar<div style="font-weight:600;font-size:11px;color:#5a6772;">RS</div></td><td align="right" sty